{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 50,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER050.YBC",
      "sha256": "e14761f8a7e7f810bdef508e2d928439ebaf4d5478c54d6a1821ff89cd93bc46",
      "text_count": 116,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 114,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "殿下。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 164,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "艾爾雪。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 198,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "我可以聽聽您心中真正的想法嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 220,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "為什麼要對這麼弱小的純潔之盾出手呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 254,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "這妳就不用問了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 282,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            5,
            6
          ],
          "text": "現在，生活在愛爾梅納斯裡，\n無意義的東西就不要去理會他。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 310,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8
          ],
          "text": "而不能不理會的東西，\n就只有去攻擊他，或是反過來被他攻擊了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 344,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 378,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "呵呵，看起來妳這段時間到處跑來跑去，"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 400,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "變成熟了不少呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 428,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            12,
            13
          ],
          "text": "這是在現在這種時局下，對新學員的特殊待遇\n嗎，還是他們根本就想把妳帶去哪裡丟掉呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 450,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            14
          ],
          "text": "妳不覺得這很有趣嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 484,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "……殿下？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 524,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17
          ],
          "text": "身為葛斯貝布洛的領導者，\n必須負起一定的責任。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 546,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "不做好自己該做的事情，將會引發事端。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 568,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "紐‧普勞迪斯所說的是對的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 594,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 634,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            21,
            22
          ],
          "text": "在純潔之盾裡，\n值得忌憚的也就只有那銀髮的薔薇了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 656,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            23
          ],
          "text": "露弗鐸可勞家的千金，究竟心向何處呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 688,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            24,
            25
          ],
          "text": "「劍將」奧吉爾‧維因哈特轉入了帕蘭達因，\n而羅沙麗亞‧奧笛納也已經離開。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 714,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "現在的純潔之盾，又能有什麼魅力呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 736,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "對於這一點，我完全不能理解。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 758,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "而這也就是我想要知道的事情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 784,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 818,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "所以我才會送那樣的信過去。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 840,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            31
          ],
          "text": "要求他們把藏匿的犯人立刻交出來。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 868,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            32,
            33
          ],
          "text": "如果不照辦的話，\n就由我們葛斯貝布洛自己動手。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 902,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "……殿下！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 930,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            35,
            36
          ],
          "text": "身為大帝國貝爾鐸可勞的棟樑，\n謬斯大公家的子嗣的您……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 952,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            37
          ],
          "text": "想不到竟然會說出這麼冷血的話來……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 986,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "聽好了，艾爾雪。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1014,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            39,
            40
          ],
          "text": "不動的橋墩收到了賢者圓桌的命令，\n要求我們攻打純潔之盾。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1048,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1088,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            42,
            43
          ],
          "text": "帕蘭達因現在似乎想要把所有與混沌有所牽連\n的人們通通趕盡殺絕。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1110,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            44
          ],
          "text": "艾爾雪啊，就是因為這樣。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1138,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            45,
            46
          ],
          "text": "就是因為這樣，我才想搞清楚他們究竟在想些\n什麼，或者會怎樣地反應呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1172,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "怎麼會……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1206,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "藏匿聖瑟維艾斯的餘孽……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1234,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            49,
            50
          ],
          "text": "將被指為異端的無能賢者─傑萊特‧羅弗利，\n從牢獄中解放。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1260,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            51
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1292,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            52,
            53
          ],
          "text": "不管是用什麼角度看也好，\n這都是在違逆賢者圓桌的意志呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1314,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            54
          ],
          "text": "無論如何，帕蘭達因都會這麼認為吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1340,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            55
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1374,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            56
          ],
          "text": "然而，真相又在哪裡呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1396,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            57
          ],
          "text": "那閃耀著光輝的眺望萬物尖塔在恐懼著什麼？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1418,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            58
          ],
          "text": "賢者圓桌又是在恐懼著什麼？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1446,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            59,
            60
          ],
          "text": "現在愛爾梅納斯即將要被「匍伏蔓延而來之物\n」毀滅，為什麼還要這樣做？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1472,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            61
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1512,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            62,
            63
          ],
          "text": "如果，我也因為那無法確認的罪名而被囚禁、\n被侮辱的話。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1540,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            64,
            65
          ],
          "text": "妳會為了去拯救我，\n而尋找一個正當的理由嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1574,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            66
          ],
          "text": "講這種話……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1608,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            67
          ],
          "text": "……看來我玩笑開得有點過火了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1642,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            68
          ],
          "text": "殿下。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1682,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            69,
            70
          ],
          "text": "然而，他們竟敢去違抗賢者圓桌的意志，\n這件事情本身令我感到非常地有興趣。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1704,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            71
          ],
          "text": "到底他們有著多大的決心呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1732,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            72,
            73
          ],
          "text": "想要親眼見証這一點，\n正是我心裡真正的想法。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1758,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            74
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1792,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            75
          ],
          "text": "妳可別說妳對這件事一點興趣都沒有呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1826,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            76
          ],
          "text": "……被您看出來了呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1854,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            77,
            78
          ],
          "text": "如果您已經下了這樣的決心的話，\n我艾爾雪也沒有什麼可以說的了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1894,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            79,
            80
          ],
          "text": "在之前的會面裡，\n真是感受到不少的樂趣呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1916,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            81
          ],
          "text": "純潔之盾的魅力。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1938,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            82
          ],
          "text": "純潔之盾令人害怕的理由。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1964,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            83
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 1996,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            84,
            85
          ],
          "text": "那些事情，\n我覺得我能夠稍微體會到一點了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2024,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            86,
            87
          ],
          "text": "接著就是要好好確認一下，\n我的感覺究竟有幾分真實性了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2050,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            88
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2090,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            89,
            90
          ],
          "text": "隨著情況的演變，\n也可能會有意想不到的變化發生呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2118,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            91,
            92
          ],
          "text": "就算進展不多，\n也至少能見到真相的吉光片羽吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2158,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            93,
            94
          ],
          "text": "究竟要向對方屈膝臣服的，\n是我們之中的哪一個呢……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2180,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            95
          ],
          "text": "真是令人躍躍欲試。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2220,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            96,
            97
          ],
          "text": "以葛斯貝布洛忠義原則來說，\n賢者圓桌的命令是絕對的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2242,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            98
          ],
          "text": "然而您還是給了我們這麼多的時間。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2264,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            99
          ],
          "text": "真的十分感謝。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2298,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            100
          ],
          "text": "哼。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2332,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            101
          ],
          "text": "然而，希望殿下日後能夠多多保重呀……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2354,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            102
          ],
          "text": "我艾爾雪懇請殿下多加留意自己的安全。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2388,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            103
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，我瞭解。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2410,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            104
          ],
          "text": "可是我不同意。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2444,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            105
          ],
          "text": "殿下……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2478,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            106
          ],
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2518,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            107,
            108
          ],
          "text": "隨便讓葛斯貝布洛的誰一起隨行，\n不是都可以嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2540,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            109
          ],
          "text": "為什麼殿下不叫他們一起來呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2574,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            110
          ],
          "text": "我是為了跟妳好好談談而來的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2600,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            111
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2634,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            112
          ],
          "text": "所以我這樣決定。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2668,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            113
          ],
          "text": "？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 50,
          "source_offset": 2708,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            114,
            115
          ],
          "text": "那樣的話，我們的討論就會受到禮儀的拘束，\n這就沒什麼意義可言吧？"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 51,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER051.YBC",
      "sha256": "2263501f9bb56546c98381a7873e8bf388a6aac899e99f35a825a4d1ce206b8e",
      "text_count": 65,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 206,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "法娜。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 256,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "帕彌菈。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 278,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "葛斯貝布洛，果然還是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 312,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "妳聽說啦？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 346,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "「儘快投降！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 368,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "否則將會毫不留情地攻擊你們。」是吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 390,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "真是充滿威脅口氣的話呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 430,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8
          ],
          "text": "……雖然都已經到了這種地步，\n不過還是有一些值得深思的事情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 458,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            9,
            10
          ],
          "text": "希里鄔司‧謬思所說的話，\n也並非完全沒有道理呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 492,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "帕彌菈……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 526,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "稍微不注意就會忘掉了吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 554,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            13,
            14
          ],
          "text": "他也曾經說過，\n不要讓幼小的孩子們做太勉強的事情呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 588,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "的確呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 616,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17
          ],
          "text": "瑟希莉絲、凱洛特、伊里安、或者是奎絲忒跟\n夏朧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 644,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            18,
            19
          ],
          "text": "雖然大家都覺得很辛苦，\n但還都非常地努力呢……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 684,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            20,
            21
          ],
          "text": "……妳也是啊，跟以前比起來，\n比較少隨便亂說話了吧，法娜？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 724,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            22,
            23
          ],
          "text": "沒錯，一旦想到了純潔之盾，\n就會想要把那些話吞回去啦～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 752,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            24,
            25
          ],
          "text": "不過呢，這感覺也並不像是在忍耐呢，\n真是有點不可思議。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 778,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 816,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            27,
            28,
            29
          ],
          "text": "不過，這件事情如果換個角度來看，\n就好像是本來無法克制衝動的行為，\n卻一百八十度變成了積壓不滿在心裡嘛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 838,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "呃，不管是偏向哪一邊，實在都很糟糕呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 872,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            31
          ],
          "text": "呵呵……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 906,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            32
          ],
          "text": "呵，笨欸妳，帕彌菈。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 928,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "不用太擔心我的情況啦。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 956,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            34,
            35
          ],
          "text": "我的心裡可是有「重建聖瑟維艾斯」的這個信\n念在支持呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 990,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "法娜……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1030,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            37,
            38
          ],
          "text": "不過，那些孩子們的心性，\n也都還沒有定下來吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1058,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            39,
            40
          ],
          "text": "所以帕彌菈要以他們的事情為第一優先，\n好好地去支持他們。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1092,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，也是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1114,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "謝謝妳。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1148,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1182,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            44
          ],
          "text": "法娜？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1216,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1250,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "如果，如果我發生了什麼意外的話……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1272,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "那時候就要拜託妳了……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1298,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1332,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "我希望能請妳代替我照顧他們……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1354,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            50
          ],
          "text": "在那些孩子們能夠自己一個人獨立之前。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1388,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            51
          ],
          "text": "帕彌菈？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1414,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            52
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1448,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            53
          ],
          "text": "我從來都不認為妳有可能會出什麼意外。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1476,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            54,
            55
          ],
          "text": "呼呼，所以呢，\n我是不接受這種不確定的請求的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1510,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            56
          ],
          "text": "……謝謝妳，法娜。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1532,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            57
          ],
          "text": "有妳在我身邊，真是太好了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1566,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            58
          ],
          "text": "好啦。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1588,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            59
          ],
          "text": "這樣，既然帕彌菈的心情變得比較好了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1610,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            60
          ],
          "text": "那也就是說，妳欠了我一次人情囉。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1644,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            61
          ],
          "text": "呵呵。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1678,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            62
          ],
          "text": "呵呵。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1700,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            63
          ],
          "text": "妳可要時時注意，別忘了要還我這份恩情啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 51,
          "source_offset": 1734,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            64
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯。"
        }
      ],
